				""
				"&5回收这些装备，能发挥它们更大的作用！"
				""
				"&5The Vault Recycler can take Vault Gear, Jewels, and some other vault items and break them down into some resources."
				""
				"&5这些资源通常可用于在Vault Forge或其他Vault Station中改进或制作装备。"
